From 4a51b682d483a32eee5a6ebf0e5e3fe86f07b5ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Mar 2026 20:54:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/98] feat(security): add opt-in toggles to bypass skill
 symlink and workspace read restrictions

- skills.load.allowSymlinksOutsideRoot: allow symlinks in skill dirs to resolve
  outside the configured root (e.g. shared skill libraries across agents)
- tools.fs.allowReadOutsideWorkspace: allow direct-API agents to read files
  outside their workspaceDir (e.g. ~/AgentData/shared/) via the read tool
- workspaceOnly and sandbox always win over allowReadOutsideWorkspace
- log warn when allowReadOutsideWorkspace is active so the grant is visible
- fix: add allowSymlinksOutsideRoot to Zod schema (strict() would reject config)
- fix: filterLoadedSkillsInsideRoot propagates allowSymlinksOutsideRoot at all call sites
